<title>NETHERLANDS: CMG DETAILS 1996 INTERIM GUILDER DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>CMG DETAILS 1996 INTERIM GUILDER DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo Dutch Computer Management Group said on Monday it had set its 1996 interim dividend in guilders at 0.0535 guilders per share.</p>
<p>Payment day is 20 November.</p>
<p>On September 17 the company announced it would pay a 1995 cash dividend of two pence per share of five pence nominal.</p>
<p>CMG shares closed at 19.50 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
